<h3>Professional profile</h3>
<p>Software developer and applied machine-learning researcher working across payment systems, mathematical modelling, and physical systems. My background combines computer science, design, and a decade of university teaching. I also maintain Mathscapes as an independent mathematical practice.</p>

<h3>Experience</h3>
<ul class="entries">
{%- set cvJobs = work | selectattr("cvBlurb") | sort(false, false, "cvOrder") %}
{%- for job in cvJobs %}
  {%- if not job.cvHide %}
  <li class="entry">
    <span class="entry-key">{{ job.years | replace("now", "present") }}</span>
    <div class="entry-body">
      <span class="entry-title">{{ job.role }}</span><span class="entry-note">, {% if job.orgUrl %}<a href="{{ job.orgUrl }}">{{ job.org }}</a>{% else %}{{ job.org }}{% endif %}, {{ job.cvPlace or job.place }}</span>
      <p class="entry-blurb">{{ job.cvBlurb }}</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  {%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
</ul>

<h3>Education</h3>
<ul class="entries">
{%- for e in education %}
  <li class="entry">
    <span class="entry-key">{{ e.years }}</span>
    <div class="entry-body">
      <span class="entry-title">{{ e.degree }}</span>
      <p class="entry-note">{% if e.institutionUrl %}<a href="{{ e.institutionUrl }}">{{ e.institution }}</a>{% else %}{{ e.institution }}{% endif %}{% if e.note %}; {{ e.note }}{% endif %}</p>
      {%- if e.blurb %}<p class="entry-blurb">{{ e.blurb }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>

<h3>Technical skills</h3>
<p>Software: C#, .NET, TypeScript, Vue, REST APIs, SQL, Git, and Azure DevOps.</p>
<p>Machine learning and modelling: Python, scikit-learn, computer vision, time-series and generative modelling, statistical inference, and nonlinear optimisation.</p>

