<h3>Teaching and academic leadership</h3>
<p>Designed and taught 30 courses and workshops over a decade (2013–2022), mostly at <a href="https://srishtimanipalinstitute.in/">Srishti Manipal Institute</a> in Bangalore, spanning creative coding, algorithmic botany, physical computing, machine learning, interaction design, and human-computer interaction.</p>

